msgid "Publish To Email"
msgstr "Publicar por e-mail"

#: includes/module/actions.php:713
msgid ""
"Mail each post of a campaign to an address that publishes it, instead of "
"publishing it here or as well as here."
msgstr ""
"Envie cada post de uma campanha a um endereço que o publica, em vez de "
"publicá-lo aqui ou além de publicá-lo aqui."

#: includes/module/actions.php:720
msgid "Requires Email Campaign addon"
msgstr "Requer o complemento Email Campaign"

#: includes/module/actions.php:724
msgid "Better Excerpts"
msgstr "Better Excerpts"

#: includes/module/actions.php:725
msgid ""
"Cut the excerpt at the length you set and back to the end of the last whole "
"sentence, never mid-word."
msgstr ""
"Corta o resumo no tamanho que você definir e recua até o fim da última frase "
"completa, nunca no meio de uma palavra."

#: includes/module/actions.php:732
msgid "Requires Better Excerpts addon"
msgstr "Requer o complemento Better Excerpts"

#: includes/module/actions.php:736
msgid "Synchronizer"
msgstr "Synchronizer"

#: includes/module/actions.php:737
msgid ""
"Update the posts you already imported when the source article changes, "
"instead of publishing a duplicate."
msgstr ""
"Atualize os posts que você já importou quando o artigo de origem mudar, em "
"vez de publicar um duplicado."

#: includes/module/actions.php:744
msgid "Requires Synchronizer addon"
msgstr "Requer o complemento Synchronizer"

#: includes/module/actions.php:748
msgid "Manual Fetching"
msgstr "Manual Fetching"

#: includes/module/actions.php:749
msgid ""
"See the items each feed will bring, and publish the ones you choose one by "
"one or in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Veja os itens que cada feed trará e publique os que escolher, um a um ou em "
"massa."

#: includes/module/actions.php:756
msgid "Requires Manual Fetching addon"
msgstr "Requer o complemento Manual Fetching"

#: includes/module/actions.php:760
msgid "Exporter"
msgstr "Exporter"

#: includes/module/actions.php:761
msgid ""
"Export your posts to a file on a schedule, in the format your template "
"defines, by download, folder, FTP or SSH."
msgstr ""
"Exporte seus posts para um arquivo conforme um agendamento, no formato que o "
"seu modelo define, por download, pasta, FTP ou SSH."

#: includes/module/actions.php:768
msgid "Requires Exporter addon"
msgstr "Requer o complemento Exporter"

#: includes/module/actions.php:772
msgid "Office"
msgstr "Office"

#: includes/module/actions.php:773
msgid ""
"Publish posts from the .docx and PDF files in a folder of your server, with "
"their text and their images."
msgstr ""
"Publique posts a partir dos arquivos .docx e PDF de uma pasta do seu "
"servidor, com o texto e as imagens."

#: includes/module/actions.php:780
msgid "Requires Office Campaign addon"
msgstr "Requer o complemento Office Campaign"

#: includes/module/actions.php:788
msgid "Rewrite Rules"
msgstr "Regras de reescrita"

#: includes/module/actions.php:789
msgid "Search and replace words or HTML in the fetched content, per campaign."
msgstr ""
"Pesquise e substitua palavras ou HTML no conteúdo coletado, por campanha."

#: includes/module/actions.php:796
msgid "Customer Support"
msgstr "Suporte ao cliente"

#: includes/module/actions.php:797
